      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "Fixed emotion_service.rs to use .map_err() instead of .context() for error conversion from async_graphql::Error to anyhow::Error. Changed postgres::get_chapter() error handling to use format! macro with Debug trait."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://gftd.ai/issue/readonly-array-sort-error",
      "name": "Read-only Array Sort Error",
      "description": "TypeError: Cannot assign to read only property '0' of object '[object Array]' when sorting chapters array from GraphQL query result.",
      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "Fixed TiptapEditor component to use useMemo hook with array spread operator ([...array]) to create a mutable copy before sorting. This prevents mutation of read-only Apollo Client cache data."
    },
