      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "Created PostgreSQL upsert functions (upsert_character, upsert_ghost, upsert_location, etc.) in postgres.rs. Implemented JSON-LD parser and mapper in scripts/import_jsonld.rs with extract_node_id function to handle various @id formats (gh:Type:identifier, character:id, etc.). Created CLI tool (bin/import_jsonld.rs) to recursively walk directories and import all JSON-LD files. Added create_pool_without_migrations function to skip migrations during import. Fixed error handling for async_graphql::Error conversion using Debug trait. Added Makefile target for import-jsonld command."
