      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "Created AIContentGenerationExtension Tiptap extension with generateContent and generateWithContext commands. Implemented multi-agent context builder (src/lib/ai/multiAgentContext.ts) to extract character, scene, and narrator contexts from JSONLD nodes. Enhanced context extractor (src/lib/editor/contextExtractor.ts) with scene character extraction and dialogue extraction. Added GraphQL mutation generateContentWithMultiAgent with OpenAI API integration in Rust backend (performers/services/graphql/src/ports/ai_service.rs). Created AIContentGenerationControls UI component with agent selection and emotion arc configuration. Implemented emotion arc generator (src/lib/ai/emotionArcGenerator.ts) for generating and analyzing emotional flows. Integrated AI generation button into TiptapEditor toolbar."
